0; font-size: 15px;\">To mark the 1st anniversary of Green Street’s CRE solutions in Canada, we are offering you a <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">free 30-day trial</span> starting today <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Thursday 19 June.</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:150%; text-align:center\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:150%; text-align:center\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">Sign up for:</span><br></span></p>\n<ul style=\"line-height:175%\">\n<li style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Daily newsletters sending you the latest CRE news across Canada</span></li>\n<li style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Verified reporting on deals, leasing activity, and leadership changes</span></li>\n<li style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Comprehensive coverage across Canada’s major CRE markets and asset-classes</span></li>\n<li style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Industry context you won’t find anywhere else, delivered several hours ahead of free sources by our seasoned journalists with deep industry ties</span></li>\n</ul>\n<div style=\"line-height:175%\"><span style=\"color: #3e464b; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold;\"> </span></div>\n<span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold;\"> </span></div>\n</div></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<!--[if gte mso 9]></table><![endif]-->\n<!--[if (mso)|(IE)]></td><![endif]-->\n\n    <!--[if (mso)|(IE)]></tr></table><![endif]-->\n\n    </div>\n   \n  </div>\n  <div id=\"section_1750245016980\" class=\"hse-section\" style=\"padding-left:10px; padding-right:10px\">\n\n    \n    \n      <div class=\"hse-column-container\" style=\"min-width:280px; max-width:600px; margin:0 auto; background-color:#194123\" bgcolor=\"#194123\">\n    \n    <!--[if (mso)|(IE)]>\n      <table align=\"center\" styl